stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Startup

    Startup --> Buffering : First segment requested
    Buffering --> Playing : Buffer >= startup threshold
    Buffering --> Error : Download failure

    Playing --> QualityUp : Buffer > target AND throughput headroom
    Playing --> QualityDown : Buffer < minimum threshold
    Playing --> Rebuffering : Buffer exhausted
    Playing --> Paused : User pause
    Playing --> [*] : Playback complete

    QualityUp --> Playing : Segment downloaded at higher bitrate
    QualityDown --> Playing : Segment downloaded at lower bitrate

    Rebuffering --> Playing : Buffer refilled to minimum
    Rebuffering --> Error : Download failure sustained

    Paused --> Playing : User resume

    Error --> [*] : Unrecoverable
    Error --> Startup : Retry
